   THE SUN: k = G M / (R c^2) = 2.122e-06 at the limb; the bending 2 f k: f = 1 0.8756 arcsec (Newton 1801, Soldner), f = 2 1.7512 arcsec (Einstein 1915; Dyson, Eddington and Davidson 1920 1.98 +- 0.16 and 1.61 +- 0.40; VLBI gamma = 0.99992 +- 0.00012, Lambert and Le Poncin-Lafitte 2011, to verify against the source)
   PPN gamma = f - 1: the six verbs with one word give f = 1, gamma = 0; nature gamma = 1 to 1.2 x 10^-4: f = 2 is an input
